{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "このまま閉じられると変更中の内容が破棄されます。\n変更を確定する場合は保存してから閉じてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you close now, your changes will be discarded.\nTo keep them, save before closing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "他メンバーのテンプレート更新が、あなたの変更と競合したので変更を破棄する必要があります。よろしいですか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Another member updated the templates in a way that conflicts with your changes, so your changes need to be discarded. Continue?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "変更内容はまだ確定していません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your changes haven't been saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "戻す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Revert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在の編集内容は破棄されます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your current edits will be discarded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "破棄" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "編集前の状態に戻しますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Revert your changes?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.1"
}